(3683269, 517361, 69487, '<td valign="top">Lit by a laptop LCD?</td>', 'Lit by a laptop LCD?', '2007-05-23 01:14:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3683295, 518010, 39144, '<td valign="top">I really like the abstract look of this shot. The green ball in comparison with the rest of the photo looking so grey really makes this shot stand out to me. And the limited DOF on the wood helps keep focus on the ball. Nice work.</td>', 'I really like the abstract look of this shot. The green ball in comparison with the rest of the photo looking so grey really makes this shot stand out to me. And the limited DOF on the wood helps keep focus on the ball. Nice work.', '2007-05-23 01:16:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3683311, 519017, 39144, '<td valign="top">Very interesting photograph. The tones throughout the image are wonderful. The super-wide lens really makes this shot interesting.</td>', 'Very interesting photograph. The tones throughout the image are wonderful. The super-wide lens really makes this shot interesting.', '2007-05-23 01:17:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3683337, 516597, 39144, '<td valign="top">I like your choice of subject here. It gives some great potential. However, I feel that the lighting is a bit flat in this particular shot, and the composition doesn''t jive well with me either. I''d like to see more of the leaf on the right, and also have it more in focus as well.</td>', 'I like your choice of subject here. It gives some great potential. However, I feel that the lighting is a bit flat in this particular shot, and the composition doesn''t jive well with me either. I''d like to see more of the leaf on the right, and also have it more in focus as well.', '2007-05-23 01:19:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3683351, 516542, 53147, '<td valign="top">.</td>', '.', '2007-05-23 01:20:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3683353, 517348, 39144, '<td valign="top">The architecture here is really interesting. The lighting is flat. The image looks tilted to the right. It would be nice to have a bit more room above the highest part of the building. I would also recommend moving your position to the right next time to keep the tree from encroaching on this wonderful building.</td>', 'The architecture here is really interesting. The lighting is flat. The image looks tilted to the right. It would be nice to have a bit more room above the highest part of the building. I would also recommend moving your position to the right next time to keep the tree from encroaching on this wonderful building.', '2007-05-23 01:20:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3683367, 518071, 39144, '<td valign="top">All right. I''m confused. Very catchy title. I wish I could make out what this was. This is one of those photos that just grabs you and keeps you searching thoughout the photo for more. Nice work.</td>', 'All right. I''m confused. Very catchy title. I wish I could make out what this was. This is one of those photos that just grabs you and keeps you searching thoughout the photo for more. Nice work.', '2007-05-23 01:21:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3683374, 518363, 39144, '<td valign="top">Very nice composotion and colors. The sharpness of the chain is amazing. I do wish, though, that the closest part of the chain could have been more in focus too.</td>', 'Very nice composotion and colors. The sharpness of the chain is amazing. I do wish, though, that the closest part of the chain could have been more in focus too.', '2007-05-23 01:22:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3683381, 518914, 39144, '<td valign="top">What a beautiful sunrise picture. I really like the inclusion of the palm branches to give more depth and size to this shot. Nice work.</td>', 'What a beautiful sunrise picture. I really like the inclusion of the palm branches to give more depth and size to this shot. Nice work.', '2007-05-23 01:23:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3683388, 516064, 39144, '<td valign="top">These spheres mysteriously look a lot like cedar balls sitting on a bright light source. Very good idea. I''m not sure if I agree with the crop or not, but the rest of the photo is really nice.</td>', 'These spheres mysteriously look a lot like cedar balls sitting on a bright light source. Very good idea. I''m not sure if I agree with the crop or not, but the rest of the photo is really nice.', '2007-05-23 01:24:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3683392, 518778, 7743, '<td valign="top">Nice colours and the shapes in the background work really well.  However, I think the image would work better if only half of the in focus bloom was in the frame.</td>', 'Nice colours and the shapes in the background work really well.  However, I think the image would work better if only half of the in focus bloom was in the frame.', '2007-05-23 01:24:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3683395, 516542, 39144, '<td valign="top">No comment.</td>', 'No comment.', '2007-05-23 01:25:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3683407, 517642, 39144, '<td valign="top">Hmmm. A large modern art sculpture. Very good idea, especially when taken at this time with the deep blue sky. How did you get your sky so dark blue? It is awesome!</td>', 'Hmmm. A large modern art sculpture. Very good idea, especially when taken at this time with the deep blue sky. How did you get your sky so dark blue? It is awesome!', '2007-05-23 01:26:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3683433, 513518, 39144, '<td valign="top">I really like this setup here but I think this particular shot has a lot more potential than what is showing here. First, I would look at the framing a bit more. It seems like you are trying to frame the shot with the bolts around the side, but some of them are cut off. Second, I would go back when it is dark, and "paint with light" to see what different and interesting effects you could come up with. I believe this shot would have a lot of potential with that. Also, the shot looks a little soft, and the colors seem a bit dull. But again, I would not stop shooting this particular peice of metal.</td>', 'I really like this setup here but I think this particular shot has a lot more potential than what is showing here. First, I would look at the framing a bit more. It seems like you are trying to frame the shot with the bolts around the side, but some of them are cut off. Second, I would go back when it is dark, and "paint with light" to see what different and interesting effects you could come up with. I believe this shot would have a lot of potential with that. Also, the shot looks a little soft, and the colors seem a bit dull. But again, I would not stop shooting this particular peice of metal.', '2007-05-23 01:28:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3683449, 518887, 67152, '<td valign="top">very nice lighting on this - the leaves seem to glow</td>', 'very nice lighting on this - the leaves seem to glow', '2007-05-23 01:30:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3683451, 518255, 39144, '<td valign="top">Great idea and excellent processing. Your composition is second to none. And your b/w conversion, awesome! If I didn''t know any better, I would say this was taken with actual b/w film, and not a digital camera. It is so brilliantly done. Nice job.</td>', 'Great idea and excellent processing. Your composition is second to none. And your b/w conversion, awesome! If I didn''t know any better, I would say this was taken with actual b/w film, and not a digital camera. It is so brilliantly done. Nice job.', '2007-05-23 01:30:13.000000', NULL, 1),
