(3684317, 518527, 54033, '<td valign="top">The main attraction is too much to the bottom left; and its tilt to the left makes it feel as if its about to leave the canvas. The vast blurred area feels dominant, especially because its not blurred enough and the tulip upfront is not sharp enough. No decisive shape there.<br/> <br/>The light feels good and its adding a nice atmosphere right in the center of the photo, and towards the right top and bottom parts of the tulip.<br/> <br/>Very well balanced saturation.</td>', 'The main attraction is too much to the bottom left; and its tilt to the left makes it feel as if its about to leave the canvas. The vast blurred area feels dominant, especially because its not blurred enough and the tulip upfront is not sharp enough. No decisive shape there. The light feels good and its adding a nice atmosphere right in the center of the photo, and towards the right top and bottom parts of the tulip. Very well balanced saturation.', '2007-05-23 06:55:35.000000', NULL, 1),
