(3686939, 514631, 70484, '<td valign="top">What a cutie! I''m sure you are probably getting dinged for the time stamp and the size. Don''t let it get to you. Go ahead and turn off the time stamp on your camera and then keep playing with your pictures to learn to resize them to the full 640 width. <br/>As far as the picture goes, I love that she is so intent on the cupcake. It all appears to be a bit out of focus, which some poeple don''t like. Keep trying though, with such a cute model and such a good eye, you will go far.</td>', 'What a cutie! I''m sure you are probably getting dinged for the time stamp and the size. Don''t let it get to you. Go ahead and turn off the time stamp on your camera and then keep playing with your pictures to learn to resize them to the full 640 width. As far as the picture goes, I love that she is so intent on the cupcake. It all appears to be a bit out of focus, which some poeple don''t like. Keep trying though, with such a cute model and such a good eye, you will go far.', '2007-05-23 15:48:40.000000', NULL, 1),
