(3691749, 516429, 77196, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot. Nice lighting / relections - not sure I''d have guessed they were olives.</td>', 'Interesting shot. Nice lighting / relections - not sure I''d have guessed they were olives.', '2007-05-24 17:38:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3691759, 514842, 77196, '<td valign="top">This is a textbook depth of field shot? I think positioning the green jack at a different angle to the camera so its one leg doesn''t get lost in the other might have been better. For me, the picture is very light, without much contrast between the colors - a rather muted effect. One might argue for a closer crop, but I like the extra jacks - I think it adds to the picture.</td>', 'This is a textbook depth of field shot? I think positioning the green jack at a different angle to the camera so its one leg doesn''t get lost in the other might have been better. For me, the picture is very light, without much contrast between the colors - a rather muted effect. One might argue for a closer crop, but I like the extra jacks - I think it adds to the picture.', '2007-05-24 17:41:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3691764, 517613, 77196, '<td valign="top">Very nice picture, but too uniform. Replacing one of the eggs with one of a contrasting color may have made a more interesting shot.</td>', 'Very nice picture, but too uniform. Replacing one of the eggs with one of a contrasting color may have made a more interesting shot.', '2007-05-24 17:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3691772, 518887, 77196, '<td valign="top">Too much of the same thing - You could have communicated the same message with a tighter crop.</td>', 'Too much of the same thing - You could have communicated the same message with a tighter crop.', '2007-05-24 17:44:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3691777, 514175, 77196, '<td valign="top">Excellent composition, great colors, and lots of interest. The red hat in the center provides a good focal point for the shot.</td>', 'Excellent composition, great colors, and lots of interest. The red hat in the center provides a good focal point for the shot.', '2007-05-24 17:46:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3691779, 518574, 77196, '<td valign="top">Nice depth of field. Would not have guessed the subject without the title.</td>', 'Nice depth of field. Would not have guessed the subject without the title.', '2007-05-24 17:46:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3691784, 517981, 77196, '<td valign="top">The muddy brown water in mid left to upper right detracts significantly from this picture. I think Pebbles would be better as a crop of the lower right 2/3 of the photo.</td>', 'The muddy brown water in mid left to upper right detracts significantly from this picture. I think Pebbles would be better as a crop of the lower right 2/3 of the photo.', '2007-05-24 17:48:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3691789, 514349, 77196, '<td valign="top">Excellent still life - the colors work very well, with excellent composition.</td>', 'Excellent still life - the colors work very well, with excellent composition.', '2007-05-24 17:49:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3691794, 518633, 77196, '<td valign="top">I love the variety of hands used in this shot. What s simple, but profound, moving image.</td>', 'I love the variety of hands used in this shot. What s simple, but profound, moving image.', '2007-05-24 17:51:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3691797, 514376, 77196, '<td valign="top">Bet it was a real trick staying out of this one.</td>', 'Bet it was a real trick staying out of this one.', '2007-05-24 17:52:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3691801, 515018, 77196, '<td valign="top">The dark / black plain background makes this shot. The contrast of white in-focus with white out-of-focus on a dark background is great!</td>', 'The dark / black plain background makes this shot. The contrast of white in-focus with white out-of-focus on a dark background is great!', '2007-05-24 17:53:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3691824, 518569, 77196, '<td valign="top">For me, this photo does not work - there is not a single focus, and visual cues (like the point of the near roof) leads your eyes to the wrong place. Is the focus the peak of the roof, the white windows, or the shadow image? I think there is a picture here - I''d try cropping it using the + in the rosettes as the upper and outer right/left edges. Nice exposure / focus. The roof peak is nicely centered in the white window vertical, but that points to the white window, which is cropped off...</td>', 'For me, this photo does not work - there is not a single focus, and visual cues (like the point of the near roof) leads your eyes to the wrong place. Is the focus the peak of the roof, the white windows, or the shadow image? I think there is a picture here - I''d try cropping it using the + in the rosettes as the upper and outer right/left edges. Nice exposure / focus. The roof peak is nicely centered in the white window vertical, but that points to the white window, which is cropped off...', '2007-05-24 18:00:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3691829, 518363, 77196, '<td valign="top">I think the fore links being out of focus distracts a lot from this picture. The chain is strong, and needs a strong anchor in the lower left of the photo - out of focus does not provide this.</td>', 'I think the fore links being out of focus distracts a lot from this picture. The chain is strong, and needs a strong anchor in the lower left of the photo - out of focus does not provide this.', '2007-05-24 18:02:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3691831, 518923, 78062, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. Maybe a little too much contrast as it kinda destroys the detail on the moon surface.<br/> <br/>I was trying to get a shot like this the other night but it failed miserably through the double glazed windows.</td>', 'Nice shot. Maybe a little too much contrast as it kinda destroys the detail on the moon surface. I was trying to get a shot like this the other night but it failed miserably through the double glazed windows.', '2007-05-24 18:02:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3691839, 517864, 77196, '<td valign="top">A simple dark background helps the shapes and colors come to life - very, very nice shot. I would have preferred a different CD cover on the top CD (like Pink Floyd''s Dark Side of the Moon, whose rainbow would tie to the colorful CD covers - but maybe that would be too obvious.)</td>', 'A simple dark background helps the shapes and colors come to life - very, very nice shot. I would have preferred a different CD cover on the top CD (like Pink Floyd''s Dark Side of the Moon, whose rainbow would tie to the colorful CD covers - but maybe that would be too obvious.)', '2007-05-24 18:04:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3691843, 518108, 77196, '<td valign="top">Interesting angle - nice subtle shadow.</td>', 'Interesting angle - nice subtle shadow.', '2007-05-24 18:05:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3691851, 518958, 77196, '<td valign="top">This might have been stronger on a plain light background - the joint of the two colors of wood in the foreground is distracting.</td>', 'This might have been stronger on a plain light background - the joint of the two colors of wood in the foreground is distracting.', '2007-05-24 18:07:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3691856, 517891, 77196, '<td valign="top">Love the colors, and the puzzle of what angle is this shot from?</td>', 'Love the colors, and the puzzle of what angle is this shot from?', '2007-05-24 18:10:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3691862, 517596, 77196, '<td valign="top">Just a little more depth of field - having the lower part and side wings of the flower out of focus hurts this shot.</td>', 'Just a little more depth of field - having the lower part and side wings of the flower out of focus hurts this shot.', '2007-05-24 18:11:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3691865, 518566, 77196, '<td valign="top">Isn''t it amazing what a slight tilt of the camera can do? Nice shot.</td>', 'Isn''t it amazing what a slight tilt of the camera can do? Nice shot.', '2007-05-24 18:12:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3691868, 518623, 78196, '<td valign="top">I like the concept a lot, especially as an English football supporter, but the image is let down by noise artifacts (is it the camera or the post-processing?) and I wonder if you could have been a bit more imaginative with the composition.</td>', 'I like the concept a lot, especially as an English football supporter, but the image is let down by noise artifacts (is it the camera or the post-processing?) and I wonder if you could have been a bit more imaginative with the composition.', '2007-05-24 18:13:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3691873, 517775, 78196, '<td valign="top">Very clever indeed. The sort of idea I wish I could think of!</td>', 'Very clever indeed. The sort of idea I wish I could think of!', '2007-05-24 18:14:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3691874, 517889, 77196, '<td valign="top">Having the whole donut in focus would have been much better. Also, a tighter crop (top at just before hole on donut just behind the one in focus) would be stronger - the photo doesn''t need the additional donuts to communicate your message. (Just scroll the page down to see what I mean.)</td>', 'Having the whole donut in focus would have been much better. Also, a tighter crop (top at just before hole on donut just behind the one in focus) would be stronger - the photo doesn''t need the additional donuts to communicate your message. (Just scroll the page down to see what I mean.)', '2007-05-24 18:14:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3691880, 518377, 78196, '<td valign="top">Nice concept and execution, and I like your use of B&amp;W for this shot, which I think works well. To my eyes it could do with some anti-clockwise rotation? (or counter-clockwise if you''re from the other side of the pond ;) )</td>', 'Nice concept and execution, and I like your use of B&W for this shot, which I think works well. To my eyes it could do with some anti-clockwise rotation? (or counter-clockwise if you''re from the other side of the pond ;) )', '2007-05-24 18:16:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3691882, 516554, 77196, '<td valign="top">Absolutely love the contrast between red and white.</td>', 'Absolutely love the contrast between red and white.', '2007-05-24 18:16:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3691886, 517179, 78196, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, and I love the different shaped glasses. However I really think a warmer light would have worked much better with the colour of the drinks, and the creases in the background are a little distracting as well.</td>', 'Nice idea, and I love the different shaped glasses. However I really think a warmer light would have worked much better with the colour of the drinks, and the creases in the background are a little distracting as well.', '2007-05-24 18:18:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3691889, 517891, 78196, '<td valign="top">Brilliant. You''ve even got the moon in there as well. My first 8.</td>', 'Brilliant. You''ve even got the moon in there as well. My first 8.', '2007-05-24 18:18:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3691891, 517401, 77196, '<td valign="top">This is a very, very tough shot - its simplicity makes it deceptive.</td>', 'This is a very, very tough shot - its simplicity makes it deceptive.', '2007-05-24 18:18:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3691896, 518387, 78196, '<td valign="top">Very neat idea but I have to admit I don''t like the colour at all. Very much a subjective thing you know!</td>', 'Very neat idea but I have to admit I don''t like the colour at all. Very much a subjective thing you know!', '2007-05-24 18:19:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3691902, 514817, 77196, '<td valign="top">A fill flash may have saved this shot from being too dark - the candle flame is already over-exposed, but the flower holder is too dark, combined with a dark background. However, this is something compelling about this photo if you look closely.</td>', 'A fill flash may have saved this shot from being too dark - the candle flame is already over-exposed, but the flower holder is too dark, combined with a dark background. However, this is something compelling about this photo if you look closely.', '2007-05-24 18:20:35.000000', NULL, 1),
