(3695980, 518916, 77196, '<td valign="top">Creative framing - white of building looks grainy.</td>', 'Creative framing - white of building looks grainy.', '2007-05-25 21:24:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3695996, 515147, 77196, '<td valign="top">Picture looks a bit grainy. It is disturbing that the brightest part of your picture is the non-descript background while the focal point of your shot - the watch face languishes in shadow. Nice focus. Framing could have been better (center top-bottom, left-right for this shot). The reflection at the top of the bezel also distracts from the photo. I like the idea, but think these things robbed you of a great shot.</td>', 'Picture looks a bit grainy. It is disturbing that the brightest part of your picture is the non-descript background while the focal point of your shot - the watch face languishes in shadow. Nice focus. Framing could have been better (center top-bottom, left-right for this shot). The reflection at the top of the bezel also distracts from the photo. I like the idea, but think these things robbed you of a great shot.', '2007-05-25 21:28:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3695998, 517795, 77196, '<td valign="top">Interesting photo - it is just missing something...</td>', 'Interesting photo - it is just missing something...', '2007-05-25 21:29:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3696000, 518619, 77196, '<td valign="top">I love the colors. Here is an example where you don''t want to crop the right side of the photo because of the color tie-ins.</td>', 'I love the colors. Here is an example where you don''t want to crop the right side of the photo because of the color tie-ins.', '2007-05-25 21:29:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3696006, 518650, 77196, '<td valign="top">Wow! Took a bit to see this picture. I know, you work with what you''ve got, but the colors are muted and the lighting is a bit dark - brighter colors and lighter would have helped.</td>', 'Wow! Took a bit to see this picture. I know, you work with what you''ve got, but the colors are muted and the lighting is a bit dark - brighter colors and lighter would have helped.', '2007-05-25 21:32:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3696010, 518235, 77196, '<td valign="top">What great color  - the right edge of photo being out of focus detracts a lot, I think.</td>', 'What great color  - the right edge of photo being out of focus detracts a lot, I think.', '2007-05-25 21:33:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3696017, 515863, 77196, '<td valign="top">Great idea - execution is lacking. Shot is too dark, vehicle windows are too much of the shot with no purpose (I think you were trying to catch reflections of the sky, but the bottom 3/4 of the windows are too dark to carry that off. The angle of the shot puts the tree with space on both the left and right - may have been better to have the tree in the upper left of the shot.</td>', 'Great idea - execution is lacking. Shot is too dark, vehicle windows are too much of the shot with no purpose (I think you were trying to catch reflections of the sky, but the bottom 3/4 of the windows are too dark to carry that off. The angle of the shot puts the tree with space on both the left and right - may have been better to have the tree in the upper left of the shot.', '2007-05-25 21:35:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3696018, 514344, 77196, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot - thank you for keeping the entire spiral and ant in focus!</td>', 'Excellent shot - thank you for keeping the entire spiral and ant in focus!', '2007-05-25 21:36:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3696032, 518714, 7786, '<td valign="top">Its hard to see any clear shapes here, its to complex. You went to far on the saturation too, its shows on the blue flowers and red/yellow background sky. In another challenge and without the oversaturation it would do alot better.</td>', 'Its hard to see any clear shapes here, its to complex. You went to far on the saturation too, its shows on the blue flowers and red/yellow background sky. In another challenge and without the oversaturation it would do alot better.', '2007-05-25 21:56:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3696248, 517179, 7743, '<td valign="top">Good choice of subject for the challenge however the arrangement is too close to the backdrop (IMO).  If it were further away then the creases would be more out of focus and blend more with the image.  As they are they are a distraction.  Also, the bright white area keeps drawing the eye away from the main subjects.</td>', 'Good choice of subject for the challenge however the arrangement is too close to the backdrop (IMO).  If it were further away then the creases would be more out of focus and blend more with the image.  As they are they are a distraction.  Also, the bright white area keeps drawing the eye away from the main subjects.', '2007-05-25 23:08:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3696272, 518274, 77661, '<td valign="top">Lighting doesn''t make sense to me,coming from different directions. Very nice outcome though.</td>', 'Lighting doesn''t make sense to me,coming from different directions. Very nice outcome though.', '2007-05-25 23:12:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3696277, 514349, 77661, '<td valign="top">Liek the texture, think the lighting could use work</td>', 'Liek the texture, think the lighting could use work', '2007-05-25 23:13:28.000000', NULL, 1);
