(3697591, 513274, 34836, '<td valign="top">I think the B/W hurts the overall picture.  The contrast between the white and the green is usually what makes these flowers stand out.  You''ve taken away some of the ''punch'' by choosing to go B/W.</td>', 'I think the B/W hurts the overall picture.  The contrast between the white and the green is usually what makes these flowers stand out.  You''ve taken away some of the ''punch'' by choosing to go B/W.', '2007-05-26 13:03:25.000000', NULL, 1),
