(3703390, 518377, 54228, '<td valign="top">I can see this in a magazine... great repeating shot.</td>', 'I can see this in a magazine... great repeating shot.', '2007-05-28 04:45:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3703391, 515184, 79095, '<td valign="top">Great idea!! I love that the image tricks the mind for a few moments. Good use of shadow to bring the focus onto the stairs too.</td>', 'Great idea!! I love that the image tricks the mind for a few moments. Good use of shadow to bring the focus onto the stairs too.', '2007-05-28 04:46:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3703394, 516089, 54228, '<td valign="top">Would have liked to see the person a bit more in focus... 7</td>', 'Would have liked to see the person a bit more in focus... 7', '2007-05-28 04:48:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3703407, 517189, 79095, '<td valign="top">Cute idea :-) Perhaps a slightly wider angle would have yielded a bit more emotion to the picture. By this I mean having the toys only in the left half of the picture leaving the right empty but for the decking.</td>', 'Cute idea :-) Perhaps a slightly wider angle would have yielded a bit more emotion to the picture. By this I mean having the toys only in the left half of the picture leaving the right empty but for the decking.', '2007-05-28 04:58:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3703412, 518791, 79095, '<td valign="top">Good subject, but I find the foreground and background a touch too distracting, especially the other flowers. Perhaps a woder aperture would help.</td>', 'Good subject, but I find the foreground and background a touch too distracting, especially the other flowers. Perhaps a woder aperture would help.', '2007-05-28 05:08:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3703556, 517891, 4162, '<td valign="top">Surely this is a winner-fabulous!!! 10</td>', 'Surely this is a winner-fabulous!!! 10', '2007-05-28 06:57:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3703559, 517499, 4162, '<td valign="top">Fabulous! I love it 10</td>', 'Fabulous! I love it 10', '2007-05-28 06:57:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3703564, 518852, 4162, '<td valign="top">Brilliant! I love it it....10</td>', 'Brilliant! I love it it....10', '2007-05-28 06:59:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3703572, 514349, 4162, '<td valign="top">what beautiful colours and tones....love it 10</td>', 'what beautiful colours and tones....love it 10', '2007-05-28 07:03:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3703574, 518070, 4162, '<td valign="top">This is lovely-beautiful colours-10</td>', 'This is lovely-beautiful colours-10', '2007-05-28 07:04:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3703660, 518590, 34836, '<td valign="top">I like the pattern and colors but, the flash hurt you on this one. The highlight on the blue block is distracting. You should try this one again and diffuse the flash.</td>', 'I like the pattern and colors but, the flash hurt you on this one. The highlight on the blue block is distracting. You should try this one again and diffuse the flash.', '2007-05-28 07:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3703664, 517179, 34836, '<td valign="top">I like the composition. Good choice of shapes and arrangement. The uneven lightng is distracting though, especially the washout on the right side.</td>', 'I like the composition. Good choice of shapes and arrangement. The uneven lightng is distracting though, especially the washout on the right side.', '2007-05-28 07:59:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3703668, 515161, 34836, '<td valign="top">Good composition. Too much contrast though. The highlights are washed out and the lighting is too strong on the left.</td>', 'Good composition. Too much contrast though. The highlights are washed out and the lighting is too strong on the left.', '2007-05-28 08:06:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3703675, 514349, 34836, '<td valign="top">I like the low key colors but I think just a touch more light would have been better. Also, the pear being right in the center sort of ruins the composition.  I would try framing it different so that the pear is in the lower and right hand 1/3 of the frame.</td>', 'I like the low key colors but I think just a touch more light would have been better. Also, the pear being right in the center sort of ruins the composition.  I would try framing it different so that the pear is in the lower and right hand 1/3 of the frame.', '2007-05-28 08:11:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3703693, 513945, 35004, '<td valign="top">The title of this is ''shape'', this is more of a portrait, no?</td>', 'The title of this is ''shape'', this is more of a portrait, no?', '2007-05-28 08:22:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3703747, 514376, 32885, '<td valign="top">IMHO there is way too much noise in this image. If the noise was deliberate then in my view it detracts from the pic. It is a great subject that could have had more impact had it been crisp.</td>', 'IMHO there is way too much noise in this image. If the noise was deliberate then in my view it detracts from the pic. It is a great subject that could have had more impact had it been crisp.', '2007-05-28 08:49:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3703751, 515204, 32885, '<td valign="top">I like the clarity of this image. Well done. I hope it does well.</td>', 'I like the clarity of this image. Well done. I hope it does well.', '2007-05-28 08:51:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3703757, 517823, 65106, '<td valign="top">Should have been centered.</td>', 'Should have been centered.', '2007-05-28 08:53:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3703772, 518701, 32885, '<td valign="top">I think I would have preferred to see this image in colour. IMHO B/W seems to lose impact here.</td>', 'I think I would have preferred to see this image in colour. IMHO B/W seems to lose impact here.', '2007-05-28 08:57:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3703797, 514349, 32885, '<td valign="top">Nice still life. I love the textures</td>', 'Nice still life. I love the textures', '2007-05-28 09:11:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3703868, 517921, 79095, '<td valign="top">Although I love long exposure water shots (they have that wonderful otherworldliness to them) I find this one a little confusing. My eye is drawn to the fall at the rear of the frame even though it seems as like the foreground falls are the subjects. If you didn''t use a polarizing filter then that may help, or possibly a graduated ND turned sideways. Essentially I find the right side of the frame overexposed and the left out of focus. Lovely subject though.</td>', 'Although I love long exposure water shots (they have that wonderful otherworldliness to them) I find this one a little confusing. My eye is drawn to the fall at the rear of the frame even though it seems as like the foreground falls are the subjects. If you didn''t use a polarizing filter then that may help, or possibly a graduated ND turned sideways. Essentially I find the right side of the frame overexposed and the left out of focus. Lovely subject though.', '2007-05-28 09:41:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3703879, 518108, 79095, '<td valign="top">Nice subject, but I think your framing and lighting could be tweaked a little. Framing-wsie I would either go for placing the handle further towards the edge of the frame, or right in the middle. For lighting I would like to see the shadow balanced out a little more.</td>', 'Nice subject, but I think your framing and lighting could be tweaked a little. Framing-wsie I would either go for placing the handle further towards the edge of the frame, or right in the middle. For lighting I would like to see the shadow balanced out a little more.', '2007-05-28 09:43:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3703883, 517290, 79095, '<td valign="top">Nice idea (good stock idea if you''re into that). But I think your models could do with either some colour to ''place'' them in context a little more, or crop them out all together leaving only their wrists. Again, great concept.</td>', 'Nice idea (good stock idea if you''re into that). But I think your models could do with either some colour to ''place'' them in context a little more, or crop them out all together leaving only their wrists. Again, great concept.', '2007-05-28 09:45:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3703888, 517910, 79095, '<td valign="top">Nice. Even though it is a result of the plant and not the photograph I would like to see the blur even on both sides. Otherwise nicely done.</td>', 'Nice. Even though it is a result of the plant and not the photograph I would like to see the blur even on both sides. Otherwise nicely done.', '2007-05-28 09:47:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3703899, 518574, 79095, '<td valign="top">Great picture! I really like the way you managed to have just the tip of the straw in focus. It really draws the eye to the shape the straw opening makes, which is of course the idea of the competition. Excellent work!</td>', 'Great picture! I really like the way you managed to have just the tip of the straw in focus. It really draws the eye to the shape the straw opening makes, which is of course the idea of the competition. Excellent work!', '2007-05-28 09:49:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3703907, 518337, 79095, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, and nice interpretation of the concept. I realyl like your lighting here, but what makes the photo is the definition you are able to pull out of the textures of the hands as a result. Perhaps the back lighting could be reduced a little, but this is really nice all around.</td>', 'Nice idea, and nice interpretation of the concept. I realyl like your lighting here, but what makes the photo is the definition you are able to pull out of the textures of the hands as a result. Perhaps the back lighting could be reduced a little, but this is really nice all around.', '2007-05-28 09:52:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3703912, 517954, 79095, '<td valign="top">I think this shot would benefit from either using a reflector or waiting for a soft light time of day to get rid of that shadow. It''s a great subject - all those wonderfully rich textures that cry out for saturation - but the shadow takes away from them.</td>', 'I think this shot would benefit from either using a reflector or waiting for a soft light time of day to get rid of that shadow. It''s a great subject - all those wonderfully rich textures that cry out for saturation - but the shadow takes away from them.', '2007-05-28 09:53:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3703915, 513518, 79095, '<td valign="top">Nice subject but the photo seems a little out of focus.</td>', 'Nice subject but the photo seems a little out of focus.', '2007-05-28 09:54:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3703917, 515485, 79095, '<td valign="top">Great subject. I don''t have too much to say - this is really nice.</td>', 'Great subject. I don''t have too much to say - this is really nice.', '2007-05-28 09:54:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3703930, 517823, 79095, '<td valign="top">Great subject!! I would crop this to have make it more centered in order to bring out the symmetry.</td>', 'Great subject!! I would crop this to have make it more centered in order to bring out the symmetry.', '2007-05-28 09:57:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3703932, 516396, 79095, '<td valign="top">Engaging subject. I love the mix of colours and shapes here. Nice shot.</td>', 'Engaging subject. I love the mix of colours and shapes here. Nice shot.', '2007-05-28 09:58:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3703938, 514943, 79095, '<td valign="top">Really nice concept. Very cool. The design idea here is really welld done and the shot well executed.</td>', 'Really nice concept. Very cool. The design idea here is really welld done and the shot well executed.', '2007-05-28 09:59:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3703944, 515463, 79095, '<td valign="top">Nice idea and great framing. I like this.</td>', 'Nice idea and great framing. I like this.', '2007-05-28 10:00:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3703954, 518590, 79095, '<td valign="top">Great interpretation of the competition idea. The reflections of the light detract from the shot significantly. If this was a flash you might want to consider difusing it some more or moving it to light from one side.</td>', 'Great interpretation of the competition idea. The reflections of the light detract from the shot significantly. If this was a flash you might want to consider difusing it some more or moving it to light from one side.', '2007-05-28 10:02:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3703960, 518351, 72833, '<td valign="top">this is really cool, but very pixalated looking. nice job though, its a great concept for shape!</td>', 'this is really cool, but very pixalated looking. nice job though, its a great concept for shape!', '2007-05-28 10:03:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3703961, 518218, 79095, '<td valign="top">Nice, but I would prefer to have the reflection appear only in the eggs and not on the surface they sit on. Great concept otherwise.</td>', 'Nice, but I would prefer to have the reflection appear only in the eggs and not on the surface they sit on. Great concept otherwise.', '2007-05-28 10:03:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3703965, 518577, 72833, '<td valign="top">interesting find. i like this bold image. angle and composition are nice. good job.</td>', 'interesting find. i like this bold image. angle and composition are nice. good job.', '2007-05-28 10:04:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3703969, 518771, 79095, '<td valign="top">Nice idea. I would like to see the ring centered or moved more to one side. Otherwise this is a nice shot.</td>', 'Nice idea. I would like to see the ring centered or moved more to one side. Otherwise this is a nice shot.', '2007-05-28 10:05:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3703970, 515802, 79095, '<td valign="top">Nice mix, but I feel like you need to open up the aperture a bit more to get everything in focus. Also, the light could probably be a little warmer.</td>', 'Nice mix, but I feel like you need to open up the aperture a bit more to get everything in focus. Also, the light could probably be a little warmer.', '2007-05-28 10:06:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3703972, 518755, 72833, '<td valign="top">wow. very nice. i love the contrast and the willow tree (i think) in the foreground. it helps create that spooky feel you get when in a graveyard. great job on this.</td>', 'wow. very nice. i love the contrast and the willow tree (i think) in the foreground. it helps create that spooky feel you get when in a graveyard. great job on this.', '2007-05-28 10:06:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3703974, 514842, 72833, '<td valign="top">love. so this is pretty much amazing to me. great job!!</td>', 'love. so this is pretty much amazing to me. great job!!', '2007-05-28 10:07:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3703976, 515778, 79095, '<td valign="top">Interesting. I think this would benefit from an early morning/late evening shot rather than middle of the day. The softer light would bring out some textures and create some drama.</td>', 'Interesting. I think this would benefit from an early morning/late evening shot rather than middle of the day. The softer light would bring out some textures and create some drama.', '2007-05-28 10:08:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3703979, 518701, 72833, '<td valign="top">cool! i love that you incorporated a vanishing point with this. very nice. i wonder what beach this was at..?</td>', 'cool! i love that you incorporated a vanishing point with this. very nice. i wonder what beach this was at..?', '2007-05-28 10:08:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3703981, 519017, 72833, '<td valign="top">i love this lense. great job with angle and lighting. the contrast is superb.</td>', 'i love this lense. great job with angle and lighting. the contrast is superb.', '2007-05-28 10:09:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3703982, 518993, 79095, '<td valign="top">Nice shot! Really like your framing here. Great subject and interpretation of the concept.</td>', 'Nice shot! Really like your framing here. Great subject and interpretation of the concept.', '2007-05-28 10:09:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3703983, 517667, 72833, '<td valign="top">this is great for shape. i love the lighting! and the sunset is beautiful. great job.</td>', 'this is great for shape. i love the lighting! and the sunset is beautiful. great job.', '2007-05-28 10:09:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3703992, 514376, 72833, '<td valign="top">umm very grainy and not very interesting. nice try on this, it is an interesting shape</td>', 'umm very grainy and not very interesting. nice try on this, it is an interesting shape', '2007-05-28 10:10:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3703995, 517022, 72833, '<td valign="top">yes! love the idea. smart to put the rings on rose pedals. great, great, great!</td>', 'yes! love the idea. smart to put the rings on rose pedals. great, great, great!', '2007-05-28 10:12:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3704000, 516444, 79095, '<td valign="top">Nice subject. I like the ambiguity.</td>', 'Nice subject. I like the ambiguity.', '2007-05-28 10:12:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3704002, 518969, 72833, '<td valign="top">this is cool. and i like how theres not just one of them. good composition and angle.</td>', 'this is cool. and i like how theres not just one of them. good composition and angle.', '2007-05-28 10:12:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3704005, 515740, 79095, '<td valign="top">You probably want to get in tighter on these to really draw the eye to them. I find I keep looking at other things in the background.</td>', 'You probably want to get in tighter on these to really draw the eye to them. I find I keep looking at other things in the background.', '2007-05-28 10:13:32.000000', NULL, 1),
