(3712687, 517130, 78303, '<td valign="top">OK, there was no dog shape.  But, the image reminded me of those picture games that force you to look for different shapes.  My goal was to have to linger over the picture and just play with the shapes for awhile.  It may have helped and hurt my overall score, but I am just glad you all had fun looking at it.  (One person really hated it and scored it as a ''1'')  I guess you cannot please everyone, but I did have fun.  Thank you for the comments.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-05-30 01:31:53.</i></td>', 'OK, there was no dog shape.  But, the image reminded me of those picture games that force you to look for different shapes.  My goal was to have to linger over the picture and just play with the shapes for awhile.  It may have helped and hurt my overall score, but I am just glad you all had fun looking at it.  (One person really hated it and scored it as a ''1'')  I guess you cannot please everyone, but I did have fun.  Thank you for the comments.', '2007-05-30 02:30:54.000000', '2007-05-30 02:31:53.000000', 0),
