(3714283, 518768, 39144, '<td valign="top">These filters do make an interesting subject. The distinct colors are pronounced ver well against the white background. Someone commented on not having the filters aligned horizontally in the photo, and I would agree that that is distracting from the overall composition. I would also recommend trying other compositions. Maybe sitting a single filter on edge, and photographing it on a level plane with very limited DOF. You could maybe use the other filters in the background, but out of focus. And then play with the lighting more to make it more dramatic.</td>', 'These filters do make an interesting subject. The distinct colors are pronounced ver well against the white background. Someone commented on not having the filters aligned horizontally in the photo, and I would agree that that is distracting from the overall composition. I would also recommend trying other compositions. Maybe sitting a single filter on edge, and photographing it on a level plane with very limited DOF. You could maybe use the other filters in the background, but out of focus. And then play with the lighting more to make it more dramatic.', '2007-05-30 12:44:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(3714369, 514725, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like the glowing orange on his neck and the speckled bokeh in the background. This has a classic feel to it, in my mind.;~D</td>', 'I like the glowing orange on his neck and the speckled bokeh in the background. This has a classic feel to it, in my mind.;~D', '2007-05-30 13:04:59.000000', NULL, 0),
