(3714872, 517130, 66398, '<td valign="top">Well I think you accomplished your goal. I definately lingered longer on your shot than I would have if it weren''t for the title. My score didn''t change one way or the other but, I did look longer. I gave you a 5. It didn''t jump out at me as one of the great ones but I didn''t see anything wrong with it either.</td>', 'Well I think you accomplished your goal. I definately lingered longer on your shot than I would have if it weren''t for the title. My score didn''t change one way or the other but, I did look longer. I gave you a 5. It didn''t jump out at me as one of the great ones but I didn''t see anything wrong with it either.', '2007-05-30 14:47:43.000000', NULL, 0),
