(3714935, 519008, 59267, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the messages!<br/>The water processed by the 6-stage RO drinking water system contains lot of tiny bubbles. I put one drop on the glass (tried hundred times) and use my imagination to see what shape it looked like. When I found the one with 3 bubbles, I added 2 additional drops to form the ears and name it aqua face. I used one single uniform back light and macro lens.</td>', 'Thanks for the messages!The water processed by the 6-stage RO drinking water system contains lot of tiny bubbles. I put one drop on the glass (tried hundred times) and use my imagination to see what shape it looked like. When I found the one with 3 bubbles, I added 2 additional drops to form the ears and name it aqua face. I used one single uniform back light and macro lens.', '2007-05-30 14:55:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(3714950, 517499, 35994, '<td valign="top">Awesome shot!! The backlighting really worked well, and the colors are just so vibrant! Definitely deserves the blue! Congrats!!</td>', 'Awesome shot!! The backlighting really worked well, and the colors are just so vibrant! Definitely deserves the blue! Congrats!!', '2007-05-30 14:57:23.000000', NULL, 0),
