(3716029, 518659, 78404, '<td valign="top">Thanks for your comments<br/> <br/>Yes it´s dark but that was intentional, just to give more focus to the shape other then what objekt it is:)<br/>This shot is of knobs of a guitar amp, standing in a line.<br/>Last knob, the sharp one, is a takumar 50mm placed in front of the knob to get it sharp.<br/>Light used is a 5600HSD in WL mode.</td>', 'Thanks for your comments Yes it´s dark but that was intentional, just to give more focus to the shape other then what objekt it is:)This shot is of knobs of a guitar amp, standing in a line.Last knob, the sharp one, is a takumar 50mm placed in front of the knob to get it sharp.Light used is a 5600HSD in WL mode.', '2007-05-30 16:06:10.000000', NULL, 0),
