(3717581, 514634, 50695, '<td valign="top">I don''t like the hokey studio lighting but the crop is very good. It''s the kind of crop you learn in art school to emphasize shape and negative space. You got a low score because DPC voters know nothing about composition. Less than nothing. They know all the wrong things.</td>', 'I don''t like the hokey studio lighting but the crop is very good. It''s the kind of crop you learn in art school to emphasize shape and negative space. You got a low score because DPC voters know nothing about composition. Less than nothing. They know all the wrong things.', '2007-05-30 23:03:25.000000', NULL, 0),
